@startuml sd_us207
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US207 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of airports-routes" as EAR
box "airports-routes-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AirportController" as AirportController
participant "RegisterAirportUseCase" as RegisterAirportUseCase
participant "UploadAirportPhotoUseCase" as UploadAirportPhotoUseCase
participant "GetAirportPhotoUseCase" as GetAirportPhotoUseCase
database "own database" as DBAR
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAR
end box
collections "peer replicas\nairports-routes-m" as PAR
== POST /api/airports ==
Actor -> EAR : POST /api/airports\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> AirportController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AirportController -> RegisterAirportUseCase : execute(...)
RegisterAirportUseCase -> DBAR : IATA code already in the catalog?
RegisterAirportUseCase -> DBAR : save airport + one copy per other replica in the outbox\n(same transaction)
RegisterAirportUseCase --> AirportController : created
AirportController --> Actor : 201 Created
OBAR -> PAR : PUT /internal/replicas/airports\n(to every other replica, retried until delivered)
PAR --> OBAR : 200 (applied if newer)
== POST /api/airports/{iataCode}/photos ==
Actor -> EAR : POST /api/airports/{iataCode}/photos\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> AirportController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AirportController -> UploadAirportPhotoUseCase : execute(...)
UploadAirportPhotoUseCase -> DBAR : apply the change to this replica's copy\n+ one copy per other replica in the outbox (same transaction)
UploadAirportPhotoUseCase --> AirportController : updated
AirportController --> Actor : 200 OK
OBAR -> PAR : PUT /internal/replicas/airports\n(to every other replica; the latest change wins)
PAR --> OBAR : 200 (applied if newer)
== GET /api/airports/{iataCode}/photos/{index} ==
Actor -> EAR : GET /api/airports/{iataCode}/photos/{index}\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> AirportController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AirportController -> GetAirportPhotoUseCase : execute(...)
GetAirportPhotoUseCase -> DBAR : read airports
note right of DBAR : catalog: complete on every replica
DBAR --> GetAirportPhotoUseCase : data
GetAirportPhotoUseCase --> AirportController : result
AirportController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id)
@enduml
